/T (NATIXIS INVESTMENT MANAGERS INTERNATIONAL Investment manager WCM INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT WCM Investment Management is a global growth equity specialist that focuses on competitive advantages and culture to seek long-term excess returns and try to mitigate downside risk.  Headquarters  Founded  Assets Under Management  \(Billion\)  Portfolio managers  Michael Hayward joined WCM in 2020; his primary  responsibility is to produce original equity research for  our global, fundamental growth strategies. Since he  began his investment career in 2009, Michael's  experience includes a position as Portfolio Manager and Equity Research Analyst at Investec Asset Management  in London and an Equity research analyst at RMB Asset  Management in Johannesburg. Prior to this he held a  position as an Actuarial Consultant at Deloitte. Michael  graduated from The University of the Witwatersrand  \(Johannesburg\) with a BSc in Statistics and Actuarial  Science and a BSc with Honors in Actuarial Science. He is  also a Fellow of the Institute and Faculty of Actuaries in  London.  Sanjay Ayer is a Portfolio Manager and Business Analyst  with WCM Investment Managers. As a member of the  Investment Strategy Group for the firms global  primary  responsibilities are portfolio management and equity  research. Mr. Ayer joined WCM in 2007 )
/E (NATIXIS INVESTMENT MANAGERS INTERNATIONAL Investment manager WCM INVESTMENT MANAGEMENT WCM Investment Management is a global growth equity specialist that focuses on competitive advantages and culture to seek long-term excess returns and try to mitigate downside risk.  Headquarters  Founded  Assets Under Management  \(Billion\)  Portfolio managers  Michael Hayward joined WCM in 2020; his primary  responsibility is to produce original equity research for  our global, fundamental growth strategies. Since he  began his investment career in 2009, Michael's  experience includes a position as Portfolio Manager and Equity Research Analyst at Investec Asset Management  in London and an Equity research analyst at RMB Asset  Management in Johannesburg. Prior to this he held a  position as an Actuarial Consultant at Deloitte. Michael  graduated from The University of the Witwatersrand  \(Johannesburg\) with a BSc in Statistics and Actuarial  Science and a BSc with Honors in Actuarial Science. He is  also a Fellow of the Institute and Faculty of Actuaries in  London.  Sanjay Ayer is a Portfolio Manager and Business Analyst  with WCM Investment Managers. As a member of the  Investment Strategy Group for the firms global  primary  responsibilities are portfolio management and equity  research. Mr. Ayer joined WCM in 2007 )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [105]
>>
